card.text:
Any time you could mulligan, you may reveal Exceptional Luck from your hand. When you do, shuffle the cards from your hand into your library, then draw that many cards.
Shuffle Exceptional Luck and the cards from your hand into your library, then draw that many cards. If Exceptional Luck was foretold, draw an additional card.
Foretell {W}{W}

Reach
When this creature enters, if it was foretold, discover 5.
Foretell {3}{W}

When Pleiadian Explorer enters or attacks, it explores.
When Pleiadian Explorer leaves the battlefield, create a number of Map tokens equal to its power.
Warp {1}{U}

As an additional cost to cast this spell, mill ten cards, then exile your graveyard. 
Squad {3}
Reach, deathtouch

Kicker {B}
Put a −1/−1 counter on target creature.
If this spell was kicked, put two −1/−1 counters on another target creature.
If this spell was cast from a graveyard, put three −1/−1 counters on another target creature.
Flashback {2}{B}{B}{hazard.png}

Return target creature card from a graveyard to the battlefield under your control. It's a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types with base power and toughness 2/2.
If this spell was cast from a graveyard, copy it. You may choose new targets for the copy.
Flashback {3}{B}{B}{hazard.png}

Scry 3, then reveal the top card of your library. Draw cards equal to that card's mana value.
Cycling {1}{U}
Madness {3}{U}{U}

Each player draws two cards. Each opponent discards three cards at random. You may discard any number of cards.
For each land card discarded by any player this way, add {U}{U}. For each creature card, inculcate. For each noncreature nonland card, draw a card.
Madness {4}{U}{U}

Ward {hazard.png}{hazard.png}
When Pocket Dimension enters, exile any number of nonland permanents you control until it leaves the battlefield. For each permanent exiled this way, exile up to one target nonland permanent until Pocket Dimension leaves the battlefield.
Sacrifice Pocket Dimension: Draw a card.

Equipped creature has first strike and haste.
Whenever equipped creature attacks, you may exile a card from your hand face down. It becomes foretold. Its foretell cost is its mana cost reduced by {2}. If you exiled a card this way, draw a card.
Equip {2}

Equipped creature gets +1/+1 and has flying.
When equipped creature dies, return that card to its owner's hand.
Equip {2}

Whenever a source deals damage to equipped creature, Aethereal Targe deals 1 damage to that source's controller.
Whenever equipped creature attacks, create a tapped and attacking token that's a copy of it, except it's a 2/2 red Illusion and has "When this creature becomes the target of a spell, sacrifice it." Exile the copy at end of combat.
Equip {2}

Equipped creature has lifelink and reach.
Whenever equipped creature attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it.
Equip {2}
